I am in the bedroom now.
My large suitcase lies on the floor.
There is a wooden wardrobe in the room.
I open the wardrobe.
I open the large suitcase too.
There are a lot of clothes in the suitcase.
I take the clothes out.
I place the clothes in the wardrobe.
My clothes sit neatly in the wardrobe.
Now the suitcase is empty.
I close the suitcase.
There is space under the bed.
I push the suitcase under the bed.
Now the suitcase lies under the bed.
My room is very neat now.
